# The node image only needs src/, crates/, Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock + the
# Dockerfile. Exclude build artifacts (target/ ~49GB) and non-node dirs so the
# Fly/Docker build context stays small.
target/
**/target/
.git/
mobile/
desktop/
os/
explorer/
fuzz/
deploy/
docs/
*.md
flake.nix

# Validator material must never enter a container build context (INF-13).
**/validator.key
**/*.sk
**/*.pem
**/slashing-protection.bin
**/passphrase*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
